{"4118020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "After the Curtain Call", "steam_appid": 4118020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Curtain Call is a first-person narrative puzzle game, which holds the story of Yujin who thinks her life as a play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Yujin, you explore the house which holds the forgotten memories about Yujin and her family. You will see what happened to Yujin in the past, and maybe understand why she is evading her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reveal the story, you use a special 'dimension camera', which can switch the dimension of objects (2D to 3D, 3D to 2D, or keep it the same) according to where you export it. All puzzles are deeply connected to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Curtain Call is a first-person narrative puzzle game, which holds the story of Yujin who thinks her life as a play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Yujin, you explore the house which holds the forgotten memories about Yujin and her family. You will see what happened to Yujin in the past, and maybe understand why she is evading her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reveal the story, you use a special 'dimension camera', which can switch the dimension of objects (2D to 3D, 3D to 2D, or keep it the same) according to where you export it. All puzzles are deeply connected to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "After the Curtain Call is a first-person, narrative puzzle game, which holds the story of Yujin who thinks her life as a play. She uses a special 'dimension camera' to switch the dimension of objects and solve puzzles. Through the journey, she face the truth that was forgotten...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audi